    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests that variable names can themselves contain variable references (nested substitution). When {@code setEnableSubstitutionInVariables(true)} is set, a template like {@code ${animal.${species}}} first resolves the inner {@code ${species}} to obtain the actual key suffix, then resolves the full key to get the final value. Also verifies that unknown variables fall back gracefully to their {@code :-default} values."
   },
